#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""creel -- run Claude Code inside a per-project Docker sandbox.

The image is LOCAL and PER-PROJECT (tagged from the directory name). Toolchains
are described once in the TOOLCHAINS table below; selecting some renders a
minimal Dockerfile containing only those, builds it, and launches Claude Code
with the project bind-mounted and auth persisted in a named volume.

Pure standard library, single file, no shell assumptions: it runs the same from
bash, zsh, fish, or anything else. Add a toolchain by adding one Toolchain entry.
"""
